              "string": "We named it \"Paradise\" and set to work"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "fixing the buildings and establishing a small"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "community for those out of favor with"
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "PIERSON"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "the Agency.  We have lived here ever since,"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "gaining new members, losing old ones, but"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "always disavowing technology and the Agency."
            },
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [20], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "I don't understand - why does the Agency let"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "you stay here? Why have they given up on"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "their pursuit of me because I made it here?"
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "PIERSON"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "We came to an agreement with the Director"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "of the Agency many, many years ago. He"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "would not wish to break it."
            },
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [5], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "... ... ..."},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "PIERSON"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "But that is enough history for one day. You wish"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "to know how you can stay here in this nirvana"
            },
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "we have been given."},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Um... yes. What exactly are these \"Trials?\""
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "PIERSON"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Anyone wishing to stay in Paradise has the"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "benefit of having their history erased - no one"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "here will pry into your past."
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "PIERSON"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "However, this is not a benefit to be lightly"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "given. We do not want this place to be a den"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "of criminals, as the Agency considers it."
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "PIERSON"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "For this reason, anyone wishing to stay must"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "complete a test of his moral fitness and strength"
            },
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "of character."},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "PIERSON"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "You will be given the Trials tomorrow morning."
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "For now, you are welcome to explore our"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "community and speak with our citizens."
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "PIERSON"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "If you successfully complete tomorrow's"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Trials, you will be asked to select one of the"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "four main professions of Paradise."
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "PIERSON"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "This will establish your role in our community,"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "so choose wisely. But for now, welcome to"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Paradise, and good luck tomorrow!"
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "PIERSON"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Please return and speak to me when you have"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "finished your explorations of our town."
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "Thank you, Sir."},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "PIERSON"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Pierson will do fine, Talan. We try not to"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "make very much of status in Paradise. Let"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "the Agency display their ranks - it is not for us."
            },
            {"code": 10210, "indent": 0, "parameters": [0, 350, 350, 0], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10210, "indent": 0, "parameters": [0, 349, 349, 0], "string": ""}
